WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.167
Welcome back to "The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:04.801
I'm Steve Higgins, and it's time to play...

00:00:04.801 --> 00:00:06.434
-Password!

00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:08.100
♪♪

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:10.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:11.934
-Let's meet our contestants.

00:00:11.934 --> 00:00:14.934
To my left, she's the founder of martha.com.

00:00:14.934 --> 00:00:16.801
Give it up for Martha Stewart!

00:00:16.801 --> 00:00:20.367
-Oh, yeah! -Come on! Come on!

00:00:20.367 --> 00:00:22.734
Martha, your partner this evening is the host

00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:27.601
of NBC's "Tonight Show" and Grammy Award-winning musician,

00:00:27.601 --> 00:00:29.767
Jimmy Fallon!

00:00:29.767 --> 00:00:33.501
Wow. Wow. When'd you add that?

00:00:33.501 --> 00:00:35.567
-Yeah. This afternoon.

00:00:35.567 --> 00:00:38.000
-Your first opponent is a member of the legendary Roots crew.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.467
Say hello to Mr. Tariq Trotter!

00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:42.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:45.167
Yeah. Grammy winner. -Keep working, man.

00:00:45.167 --> 00:00:47.300
-And his partner is starring in the limited series

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:50.100
"George &amp; Tammy" premiering December 4th on Showtime.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.067
It's Jessica Chastain.

00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:54.968
My God.

00:00:54.968 --> 00:00:56.868
Wow! Very nice!

00:00:56.868 --> 00:00:59.133
The rules of the game are very simple.

00:00:59.133 --> 00:01:01.267
I will give each of you a password.

00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:03.601
And then you are to give a one-word clue, one word only,

00:01:03.601 --> 00:01:06.033
to get your partner to guess that password.

00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:09.267
The team with the most points after four words wins.

00:01:09.267 --> 00:01:12.834
And the first clue goes to Jimmy and Tariq.

00:01:12.834 --> 00:01:14.501
-Wow.

00:01:14.501 --> 00:01:16.734
-The password is...

00:01:16.734 --> 00:01:18.968
-Tariq, why don't you start us off?

00:01:18.968 --> 00:01:20.834
-Oh, geez.

00:01:20.834 --> 00:01:24.467
-Hm. Hmm.

00:01:24.467 --> 00:01:27.000
-Okay. -This is Tariq.

00:01:29.534 --> 00:01:32.734
-[ Laughs ] -Turkey.

00:01:32.734 --> 00:01:35.100
-Thanksgiving. -Ooh, no.

00:01:37.501 --> 00:01:39.667
You got this one.

00:01:42.601 --> 00:01:44.000
-So we already know the one clue.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.234
-Yeah, one clue. -Oh, it's the same?

00:01:46.234 --> 00:01:49.267
-Same clue, but he said -- -His clue was --

00:01:49.267 --> 00:01:50.968
-Turkey.

00:01:50.968 --> 00:01:52.100
-Okay.

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:53.701
Sound.

00:01:56.067 --> 00:01:57.234
-Gobble.

00:01:57.234 --> 00:01:58.601
-Yeah! Wow!

00:01:58.601 --> 00:02:00.234
[ Bell dinging ]

00:02:00.234 --> 00:02:04.167
Whoa, man! Yes! Snap!

00:02:04.167 --> 00:02:05.601
-You said a thousand words!

00:02:05.601 --> 00:02:07.934
He said, "We already know the one clue.

00:02:07.934 --> 00:02:10.234
So we know his clue..." -Playing by the rules!

00:02:10.234 --> 00:02:11.868
And you know what? -Okay.

00:02:11.868 --> 00:02:15.067
-♪ This is how you do it ♪

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:17.667
-Jessica, there you go. -Oh, sorry, Martha.

00:02:17.667 --> 00:02:20.334
-Alright. You guys the clues. -Do we look?

00:02:20.334 --> 00:02:23.601
-The password is...

00:02:23.601 --> 00:02:26.067
-Who goes first? -Martha, you are up first.

00:02:28.133 --> 00:02:30.234
-Um...

00:02:30.234 --> 00:02:32.400
[Sweetly] pumpkin.

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:35.234
-Hmm.

00:02:35.234 --> 00:02:36.434
Pumpkin.

00:02:36.434 --> 00:02:39.934
-You said it very cute. Like, "Pumpkin!"

00:02:39.934 --> 00:02:43.334
Is it, like, a little pumpkin? Like a "pumpkin"?

00:02:43.334 --> 00:02:45.167
-Could be. -Could be.

00:02:45.167 --> 00:02:46.267
I would say squash.

00:02:46.267 --> 00:02:47.467
-Whoa!

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:50.501
[ Bell dinging ]

00:02:50.501 --> 00:02:52.200
Ohh! Ohh-oh!

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:54.567
-We are the best at this! You kidding me?

00:02:54.567 --> 00:02:57.234
-Oh, my God! -11...

00:02:57.234 --> 00:02:59.267
-That was very well done. -Oh, my gosh.

00:02:59.267 --> 00:03:00.968
You got squashed, Tariq. Sorry about that.

00:03:00.968 --> 00:03:02.767
-That was so good! That was so good!

00:03:02.767 --> 00:03:04.200
I love that clue. -Jimmy and Tariq.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:05.300
-Alright. -Alright. Here we go.

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:07.901
-The password is...

00:03:07.901 --> 00:03:09.501
-Jimmy, why don't you start us off this time?

00:03:09.501 --> 00:03:11.067
No cheating.

00:03:11.067 --> 00:03:12.567
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.567 --> 00:03:14.501
-This time. -No cheating.

00:03:14.501 --> 00:03:16.400
-Um...

00:03:19.467 --> 00:03:21.000
Macy's!

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.267
-Parade.

00:03:22.267 --> 00:03:24.167
[ Bell dinging ]

00:03:24.167 --> 00:03:27.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:27.667 --> 00:03:31.434
-Oh, my God! Okay.

00:03:31.434 --> 00:03:33.601
The final -- The final clue --

00:03:33.601 --> 00:03:36.234
-Jessica, are you having fun? -Yes. Yes.

00:03:36.234 --> 00:03:38.767
This is the best game. -You're having the best time.

00:03:38.767 --> 00:03:40.767
You guys are crushing us. -Okay. Jessica, Martha.

00:03:40.767 --> 00:03:43.200
This one is worth one million points.

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.000
-The password is...

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:46.701
-Does Jessica get to say anything?

00:03:46.701 --> 00:03:48.901
-Yes, it's her turn. She's going to start it off.

00:03:48.901 --> 00:03:50.234
-Good. I want her to have fun.

00:03:50.234 --> 00:03:51.801
-If she wins, it's one million points.

00:03:51.801 --> 00:03:53.834
-Oh, my goodness. -Who starts?

00:03:53.834 --> 00:03:54.968
-Jessica. -Jessica's gonna start.

00:03:54.968 --> 00:03:58.033
-Oh, geez. Okay.

00:04:00.434 --> 00:04:02.234
[ Chuckles ] Can I move my hands at all?

00:04:02.234 --> 00:04:03.601
-Yes. That's legal. -No!

00:04:03.601 --> 00:04:04.834
What are you talking about?!

00:04:04.834 --> 00:04:06.367
-Ready? -Yes, she can.

00:04:06.367 --> 00:04:07.634
-Football!

00:04:07.634 --> 00:04:10.400
-Oh, absolutely not. Absolutely not.

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:12.067
-Touchdown. -Yes.

00:04:12.067 --> 00:04:14.267
[ Bell dinging ]

00:04:14.267 --> 00:04:16.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:16.133 --> 00:04:18.834
-Wow. My thanks to Jessica Chastain.

00:04:18.834 --> 00:04:22.567
The champion. Jessica and Tariq.

00:04:22.567 --> 00:04:26.167
Martha Stewart! Come on! Higgins. I love ya.

00:04:26.167 --> 00:04:28.968
We'll be right back with more "Tonight Show." Stick around.

